{"version":1,"key":"card:463","content":{"id":463,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f425e42c-1df6-4929-8b29-09674093e3ed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"私有属性不能从对象外部访问，而只能通过存取器方法（如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get_name"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set_name"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）来访问。Python 没有为私有属性提供直接的支持，而是要求程序员知道在什么情况下从外部修改属性是安全的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64eb0ee8-76e2-48dd-8261-03a41c03c8ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要让方法或属性成为私有的（不能从外部访问），只需让其名称以两个下划线打头即可"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"09a44e17-054f-472e-8cb2-3f9f82129928","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c79b6eb7-4fa9-4f6c-80cf-43dbf0ffc575","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Secretive:\n\n\n    def __inaccessible(self):\n      print(\"Bet you can't see me ...\")\n\n\n    def accessible(self):\n      print(\"The secret message is:\")\n      self.__inaccessible()","collabId":"f3bddbc8-e735-431a-9415-513ac82b7d0d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"d111ed28-5aa2-4717-a953-5aa18f1820e6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1fa8ba4a-9038-4a98-b465-e61d1f751e23","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> s = Secretive()\n>>> s.__inaccessible()\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nAttributeError: Secretive instance has no attribute '__inaccessible'\n>>> s.accessible()\nThe secret message is:\nBet you can't see me ...","collabId":"333087bc-90e9-411b-bc8c-3545e4810971","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dab4e541-4781-474b-a4ee-fd89a013e3d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在类定义中，对所有以两个下划线打头的名称都进行转换，即在开头加上"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"157caecb-ea7b-431f-b2f2-916a1fcc8f06","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个下划线和类名"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7e2a2564-92a2-459d-a8f4-4b5570b50292","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只要知道这种幕后处理手法，就能从类外访问私有方法，然而不应这样做"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"f46f5ca3-51d0-4d43-b84e-b797ac1f6189","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e5fe628e-30b7-4c88-b8e1-83a5b0460725","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> s._Secretive__inaccessible()\nBet you can't see me ...","collabId":"dbaa2af7-7c56-410b-be5f-96384f533024","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"76fad724-6c1b-409d-8d42-e3685dcb593f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"总之，你"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"0731c39e-fbff-4561-9fc7-369ff73d5262","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法禁止别人访问对象的私有方法和属性"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但这种名称修改方式发出了强烈的信号，让他们不要这样做。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"05a0ac9d-94d8-4c18-aa94-debd510b38c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你不希望名称被修改，又想发出不要从外部修改属性或方法的信号，可用"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"6951c253-d1c3-4060-8ce2-f31811572bdd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个下划线"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"打头。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6425371c-03f0-4311-8ac1-73e458de156f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"from module import *"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不会导入以一个下划线打头的名称。"}]}],"tags":["Python/类"],"createTime":1719225947209,"updateTime":1743303640441,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640441}}